1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#E8F0E8;strokeColor=#5C815D;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243745;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=18;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="550" width="400" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="B" value="B · 낮은 5연타 · P2&#10;잠입 0.28 + 이동 0.38&#10;땅속 5연타 예고 1.80&#10;첫 예고 합계 2.46초" style="shape=rectangle;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#E8F0E8;strokeColor=#5C815D;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243745;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=18;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="550" width="400" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="C" value="C · 높은 전방 도약 · P1·P2&#10;P1 예고 0.48 + 0.65 + 0.68&#10;P2 예고 0.28 + 0.38 + 0.68&#10;예고 합계 P1 1.81 / P2 1.34" style="shape=rectangle;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#E8EDF7;strokeColor=#6478A0;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243745;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=17;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="550" width="400" height="175" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="slam" value="낮은 단타 Active 0.24초&#10;실제 피해: 0.06~0.24초&#10;최종 회복 없이 재잠입으로 연결" style="shape=rectangle;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#E8F0E8;strokeColor=#5C815D;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243745;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=18;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="780" width="400" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="reburrow" value="다시 잠입 0.26초&#10;회복을 취소한 동작이 아님" style="shape=rectangle;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#EFF4F7;strokeColor=#587084;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243745;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=18;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="965" width="400" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="direct" value="다음 땅굴로&#10;직결하는가?" style="shape=rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=0;arcSize=12;fillColor=#FFF5D8;strokeColor=#B1892B;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243745;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=18;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="1120" width="300" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="next" value="60% · 다음 땅굴 직결&#10;새 피해 ID·새 목표 저장&#10;잠입 생략. 이동 + 분기 예고&#10;일반 선택·쿨다운 검사 생략" style="shape=rectangle;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#EFF4F7;strokeColor=#587084;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243745;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=18;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="1345" width="400" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="reemerge" value="40% · 다시 드러남 0.26초&#10;일반 판단으로 돌아갈 준비" style="shape=rectangle;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#EFF4F7;strokeColor=#587084;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243745;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=18;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="1560" width="400" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="waitA" value="판단 대기&#10;P2 0.32~0.44초" style="shape=rectangle;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#EFF4F7;strokeColor=#587084;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243745;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=18;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="1710" width="400" height="95" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="whole" value="공통 좌우 5연타 실행&#10;왼쪽·오른쪽·왼쪽·오른쪽&#10;4타 접촉 종료 뒤 1.05초 대기&#10;마지막 왼쪽 5타&#10;전체 Active 2.97 / 각 타 피해 0.18" style="shape=rectangle;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#E8F0E8;strokeColor=#5C815D;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243745;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=17;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="780" width="400" height="220" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="recoveryB" value="긴 회복 1.90초&#10;회복 끝까지 땅굴 